# Wrath Remix's campaign, Chapters II to VII and the end, as the Horde has them: the story's quests
# and scenes, Moratari's transitions, Eternus's agents in each chapter and his last hour, the
# return to the Bazaar, the goodbyes, and the way home to ChromieCraft. Played by CI as a level 30
# orc (auth_check.py script, on the Remix realm), levelled with each chapter. The original quests
# before each step are given and turned in with GM commands, the story's own are played, and what
# each opens, and who can be seen, is checked.

# (the opening is the prologue test's)
wait 4
cmd .remix intro skip
wait 3
cmd .levelup 20
wait 2
# (no harm comes to the test's character: it doesn't fight, a GM command kills for it)
cmd .cheat god on
cmd .remix
expect level 30

# Chapter II's story (STORY.md). WRM-213 (A Summons from Wyrmrest): The Forsaken Blight done.
# Agmar's Hammer's errands would come next; The Kor'kron Vanguard! isn't open yet, and
# Moratari by Doctor Sintar Malefious has the summons first.
cmd .quest add 12221
cmd .quest complete 12221
cmd .quest reward 12221
# (one of the quests Eternus quietly changed: he says so, a moment after it's turned in)
wait 4
expect I took one vial
go 571 3842.4 1489.6 92.6
talk 26379
expect-not quest 12224
go 571 3747.0 1603.4 87.5
talk 770001
expect quest 77213
expect-not quest 77211
accept 770001 77213
reward 770001 77213
expect rewarded 77213
